      $$Tunisia maintains developed telecommunications infrastructure including mobile networks, fiber broadband, and submarine cable connectivity supporting domestic and export-oriented ICT services. The country has a strong technology startup ecosystem, digital skills base, and French/English language capabilities serving nearshore outsourcing markets. E-government services are relatively advanced. Digital free zones support ICT investment. Government digital economy strategies target startup support and technology exports. The sector represents opportunity for ICT services exports, startup ecosystem development, digital outsourcing, and technology infrastructure serving European and regional markets leveraging Tunisia's talent pool and geographic positioning.$$,
